{"agent_id":"pp3g-4GkB-research-read-only-issue-399-query-the-opencode-zen","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-08-18T06:26:22.951822562Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"1e1b3fb6-26dd-4b35-a57b-76443f972be9","comment_uuid":"dea3bdee-ad38-4a91-9b28-a8ff3a96e71f","author":"pp3g-4GkB-research-read-only-issue-399-query-the-opencode-zen","content":"Result: OpenCode Zen API Model List — Full Findings\n\n## API Endpoints Queried\n\n1. **Zen (free tier)**: https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/models — HTTP 200, no auth required\n2. **Zen Go (paid tier)**: https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1/models — HTTP 200, no auth required\n\nBoth endpoints returned valid JSON without authentication.\n\n---\n\n## Zen API (free tier) — 62 models, all owned_by: \"opencode\"\n\nclaude-fable-5, claude-opus-5, claude-opus-4-8, claude-opus-4-7, claude-opus-4-6, claude-opus-4-5, claude-sonnet-5, claude-sonnet-4-6, claude-sonnet-4-5, claude-sonnet-4, claude-haiku-4-5, gemini-3.6-flash, gemini-3.7-flash, gemini-3.5-flash-lite, gemini-3.5-flash, gemini-3.1-pro, gemini-3-flash, gpt-5.6-sol, gpt-5.6-terra, gpt-5.6-luna, gpt-5.5, gpt-5.5-pro, gpt-5.4, gpt-5.4-pro, gpt-5.4-mini, gpt-5.4-nano, gpt-5.3-codex-spark, gpt-5.3-codex, gpt-5.2, gpt-5.2-codex, gpt-5.1, gpt-5.1-codex-max, gpt-5.1-codex, gpt-5.1-codex-mini, gpt-5, gpt-5-codex, gpt-5-nano, grok-build-0.1, grok-4.6, grok-4.5, muse-spark-1.2, deepseek-v4-pro, deepseek-v4-flash, glm-5.2, glm-5.1, glm-5, minimax-m3, minimax-m2.7, minimax-m2.5, kimi-k3, kimi-k2.7-code, kimi-k2.6, kimi-k2.5, qwen3.6-plus, qwen3.5-plus, big-pickle, deepseek-v4-flash-free, mimo-v2.5-free, hy3-free, nemotron-3-ultra-free, nemotron-3.5-lightning-free, laguna-s-2.1-free\n\n## Zen Go API (paid tier) — 26 models, all owned_by: \"opencode\"\n\nminimax-m3, minimax-m2.7, minimax-m2.5, kimi-k3, kimi-k2.7-code, kimi-k2.6, kimi-k2.5, glm-5.2, glm-5.3, glm-5.1, glm-5, deepseek-v4-pro, deepseek-v4-flash, qwen3.7-max, qwen3.8-max, qwen3.7-plus, qwen3.6-plus, qwen3.5-plus, mimo-v2-pro, mimo-v2-omni, mimo-v2.5-pro, mimo-v2.5, hy3, hy3-preview, gpt-5.6-luna, grok-4.5\n\n---\n\n## Specific Model Verification\n\n### Hy3\n- **Zen API**: YES — model ID is `hy3-free` (free tier)\n- **Zen Go API**: YES — model IDs are `hy3` and `hy3-preview` (paid)\n- **No plain `hy3` on free tier** — only `hy3-free`\n\n### Muse Spark\n- **Zen API**: YES — model ID is `muse-spark-1.2`\n- **Zen Go API**: NOT present\n- **The exact API ID is `muse-spark-1.2`**, NOT `meta/muse-spark` (the meta/ prefix is not used)\n\n### Gemini 3.7\n- **Zen API**: Partially — model ID is `gemini-3.7-flash`\n- **Zen Go API**: NOT present\n- **There is NO plain `gemini-3.7`** — only `gemini-3.7-flash` exists\n\n---\n\n## Comparison: API vs Local `opencode models`\n\n### `opencode models opencode` (local) — only 5 models shown:\nbig-pickle, deepseek-v4-flash-free, laguna-s-2.1-free, mimo-v2.5-free, nemotron-3-ultra-free\n\n### Zen API returns 62 models — **57 models missing from local cache**\n\nThe local cache is severely stale. It only shows free-tier models and omits all Claude, Gemini, GPT, Grok, Muse Spark, and most other models.\n\n### `opencode models opencode-go` (local) — 25 models shown:\nAll 25 are present in the Go API. The Go API returns 26 models — the one missing locally is `grok-4.5`.\n\n---\n\n## Key Differences Between Zen and Zen Go APIs\n\nGo-only models (not in Zen): glm-5.3, qwen3.7-max, qwen3.8-max, qwen3.7-plus, mimo-v2-pro, mimo-v2-omni, mimo-v2.5-pro, mimo-v2.5, hy3, hy3-preview\n\nZen-only models (not in Go): All Claude models, all Gemini models, all GPT models (except gpt-5.6-luna), grok-build-0.1, grok-4.6, muse-spark-1.2, big-pickle, all free-tier models","created_at":"2026-08-18T06:26:22.937197776Z","kind":"note","signed_by":"SHA256:xYIR3DFKYcmswdkwwwKxBnGVlKNmTeMsYxMY01m21GM","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5tcqZnb55emp/2UjMlrpqRdNYHOEb5DgcSkNX7EsqJ4AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAtvIczG90dMbsX4Fdxi